  "source": {
    "bytes": 2318,
    "catalog_metadata": {
      "bundle_offset": 4422380,
      "category": "product",
      "content_binding": null,
      "description": "Turn PRDs and feature specs into implementation plans, tasks, and progress tracking. Essential for product designers managing handoffs.",
      "github_url": "https://github.com/openai/skills/tree/main/skills/.curated/notion-spec-to-implementation",
      "slug": "notion-spec-to-implementation",
      "source": "openai",
      "source_label": "OpenAI",
      "stars_reported": 1800,
      "template_expressions": [],
      "title": "Notion Spec to Implementation"
    },
    "line_table": [
      {
        "line": 1,
        "text": "---"
      },
      {
        "line": 2,
        "text": "name: notion-spec-to-implementation"
      },
      {
        "line": 3,
        "text": "description: Turn Notion specs into implementation plans, tasks, and progress tracking."
      },
      {
        "line": 4,
        "text": "---"
      },
      {
        "line": 5,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 6,
        "text": "# Spec to Implementation"
      },
      {
        "line": 7,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 8,
        "text": "Convert a Notion spec into linked implementation plans, tasks, and ongoing status updates."
      },
      {
        "line": 9,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 10,
        "text": "## Quick Start"
      },
      {
        "line": 11,
        "text": "1. Locate the spec, then fetch it"
      },
      {
        "line": 12,
        "text": "2. Parse requirements and ambiguities"
      },
      {
        "line": 13,
        "text": "3. Create a plan page (pick template: quick vs. full)"
      },
      {
        "line": 14,
        "text": "4. Find task database, confirm schema, create tasks"
      },
      {
        "line": 15,
        "text": "5. Link spec \u2194 plan \u2194 tasks; keep status current"
      },
      {
        "line": 16,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 17,
        "text": "## Workflow"
      },
      {
        "line": 18,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 19,
        "text": "### 1) Locate and Read the Spec"
      },
      {
        "line": 20,
        "text": "- Search for the spec; if multiple hits, ask user which to use"
      },
      {
        "line": 21,
        "text": "- Fetch the page and scan for:"
      },
      {
        "line": 22,
        "text": "  - Requirements"
      },
      {
        "line": 23,
        "text": "  - Acceptance criteria"
      },
      {
        "line": 24,
        "text": "  - Constraints"
      },
      {
        "line": 25,
        "text": "  - Priorities"
      },
      {
        "line": 26,
        "text": "- Capture gaps/assumptions in a clarifications block before proceeding"
      },
      {
        "line": 27,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 28,
        "text": "### 2) Choose Plan Depth"
      },
      {
        "line": 29,
        "text": "- **Simple change** \u2192 quick implementation plan"
      },
      {
        "line": 30,
        "text": "- **Multi-phase feature/migration** \u2192 standard implementation plan"
      },
      {
        "line": 31,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 32,
        "text": "**Plan includes**:"
      },
      {
        "line": 33,
        "text": "- Overview"
      },
      {
        "line": 34,
        "text": "- Linked spec"
      },
      {
        "line": 35,
        "text": "- Requirements summary"
      },
      {
        "line": 36,
        "text": "- Phases"
      },
      {
        "line": 37,
        "text": "- Dependencies/risks"
      },
      {
        "line": 38,
        "text": "- Success criteria"
      },
      {
        "line": 39,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 40,
        "text": "### 3) Create Tasks"
      },
      {
        "line": 41,
        "text": "- Find the task database and confirm required properties"
      },
      {
        "line": 42,
        "text": "- Size tasks to 1-2 days"
      },
      {
        "line": 43,
        "text": "- Each task includes:"
      },
      {
        "line": 44,
        "text": "  - Context"
      },
      {
        "line": 45,
        "text": "  - Objective"
      },
      {
        "line": 46,
        "text": "  - Acceptance criteria"
      },
      {
        "line": 47,
        "text": "  - Dependencies"
      },
      {
        "line": 48,
        "text": "  - Resources"
      },
      {
        "line": 49,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 50,
        "text": "**Task properties**:"
      },
      {
        "line": 51,
        "text": "- Title with action verb"
      },
      {
        "line": 52,
        "text": "- Status"
      },
      {
        "line": 53,
        "text": "- Priority"
      },
      {
        "line": 54,
        "text": "- Relations to spec + plan"
      },
      {
        "line": 55,
        "text": "- Due date/story points/assignee (if provided)"
      },
      {
        "line": 56,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 57,
        "text": "### 4) Link Artifacts"
      },
      {
        "line": 58,
        "text": "- Plan links to spec"
      },
      {
        "line": 59,
        "text": "- Tasks link to both plan and spec"
      },
      {
        "line": 60,
        "text": "- Optionally update spec with \"Implementation\" section"
      },
      {
        "line": 61,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 62,
        "text": "### 5) Track Progress"
      },
      {
        "line": 63,
        "text": "- Post regular updates"
      },
      {
        "line": 64,
        "text": "- Close phases with milestone summaries"
      },
      {
        "line": 65,
        "text": "- Keep checklists and status fields in sync"
      },
      {
        "line": 66,
        "text": "- Note blockers and decisions"
      },
      {
        "line": 67,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 68,
        "text": "## Plan Templates"
      },
      {
        "line": 69,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 70,
        "text": "### Quick Implementation Plan"
      },
      {
        "line": 71,
        "text": "For simple changes:"
      },
      {
        "line": 72,
        "text": "- Single phase"
      },
      {
        "line": 73,
        "text": "- Few tasks"
      },
      {
        "line": 74,
        "text": "- Short timeline"
      },
      {
        "line": 75,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 76,
        "text": "### Standard Implementation Plan"
      },
      {
        "line": 77,
        "text": "For complex features:"
      },
      {
        "line": 78,
        "text": "- Multiple phases"
      },
      {
        "line": 79,
        "text": "- Dependencies mapped"
      },
      {
        "line": 80,
        "text": "- Risk assessment"
      },
      {
        "line": 81,
        "text": "- Rollback plan"
      },
      {
        "line": 82,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 83,
        "text": "## Task Structure"
      },
      {
        "line": 84,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 85,
        "text": "```"
      },
      {
        "line": 86,
        "text": "Task: [Action Verb] [Component/Feature]"
      },
      {
        "line": 87,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 88,
        "text": "Context:"
      },
      {
        "line": 89,
        "text": "- Why this task exists"
      },
      {
        "line": 90,
        "text": "- Related spec requirements"
      },
      {
        "line": 91,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 92,
        "text": "Objective:"
      },
      {
        "line": 93,
        "text": "- What \"done\" looks like"
      },
      {
        "line": 94,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 95,
        "text": "Acceptance Criteria:"
      },
      {
        "line": 96,
        "text": "- [ ] Specific, testable criteria"
      },
      {
        "line": 97,
        "text": "- [ ] Edge cases covered"
      },
      {
        "line": 98,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 99,
        "text": "Dependencies:"
      },
      {
        "line": 100,
        "text": "- Blocks: [tasks that block this]"
      },
      {
        "line": 101,
        "text": "- Blocked by: [tasks this depends on]"
      },
      {
        "line": 102,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 103,
        "text": "Resources:"
      },
      {
        "line": 104,
        "text": "- Design files"
      },
      {
        "line": 105,
        "text": "- Technical docs"
      },
      {
        "line": 106,
        "text": "- Related PRs"
      },
      {
        "line": 107,
        "text": "```"
      }
    ],
